# Two fits, each keeping a figure for itself and one for its residuals (#178). The first draws both; it then lends its
# residuals' figure to the second (`other.res_fig, other.res_ax = self.res_fig, self.res_ax`), which draws its own figure
# and its residuals on the one lent. Each figure is made only where its own field holds none: `create_figure` under
# `self.ax is None`, `create_residuals` under `self.res_ax is None`. A condition that reads a field of the slot a figure
# is made in makes the slot's figure sure of (#11, #184): the second fit's residuals stay on the first's figure, and its
# own figure is made where it holds none. Three figures, each named where it is made.

route notebooks.residuals
step residuals/draw_both
step residuals/draw_both/Fit()
step residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw
choice residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw/?1
step residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw/?1/Fit.create_figure
choice residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw/?2
step residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw/?2/Fit.create_residuals
step residuals/draw_both/Fit()#2
step residuals/draw_both/Fit.lend
step residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw#2
choice residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw#2/?1
step residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw#2/?1/Fit.create_figure
choice residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw#2/?2
step residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw#2/?2/Fit.create_residuals

line entry > residuals call

# the first fit makes both its figures, each where its field holds none
line residuals/draw_both/Fit() > Fit·fit@residuals/draw_both/Fit() value
line Fit·fit@residuals/draw_both/Fit() > residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw/?1/Fit.create_figure value
line residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw/?1/Fit.create_figure > Figure 1 · Fit · fit.fig own   # `plt.subplots()`
line residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw/?1/Fit.create_figure > Fit·self@residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw/?1 value
line Fit·self@residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw/?1 > residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw/?2/Fit.create_residuals value
line residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw/?2/Fit.create_residuals > Figure 2 · Fit · fit.res_fig own   # `plt.subplots()`
line residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw/?2/Fit.create_residuals > Fit·self@residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw/?2 value
line Fit·self@residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw/?2 > residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw value   # `self.ax.plot(..)`, `self.res_ax.plot(..)`
line residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw > Fit·fit@residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw value

# it lends its residuals' figure to the second
line residuals/draw_both/Fit()#2 > Fit·other@residuals/draw_both/Fit()#2 value
line Fit·other@residuals/draw_both/Fit()#2 > residuals/draw_both/Fit.lend value
line Fit·fit@residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw > residuals/draw_both/Fit.lend value   # `self.res_fig, self.res_ax`
line residuals/draw_both/Fit.lend > Fit·other@residuals/draw_both/Fit.lend value

# the second makes its own figure, where it holds none, and draws its residuals on the one lent
line Fit·other@residuals/draw_both/Fit.lend > residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw#2/?1/Fit.create_figure value
line residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw#2/?1/Fit.create_figure > Figure 3 · Fit · other.fig own
line residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw#2/?1/Fit.create_figure > Fit·self@residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw#2/?1 value
line Fit·self@residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw#2/?1 > residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw#2/?2/Fit.create_residuals value
line residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw#2/?2/Fit.create_residuals > Figure 2 · Fit · fit.res_fig own
line residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw#2/?2/Fit.create_residuals > Fit·self@residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw#2/?2 value
line Fit·self@residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw#2/?2 > residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw#2 value
line residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw#2 > Fit·other@residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw#2 value
line Fit·other@residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw#2 > residuals/draw_both value   # `return other`
line residuals/draw_both > Fit·fit@residuals/draw_both value                 # `fit = draw_both(..)`

home Fit·fit@residuals/draw_both/Fit() residuals/draw_both
home Fit·self@residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw/?1 residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw
home Fit·self@residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw/?2 residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw
home Fit·fit@residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw residuals/draw_both
home Fit·other@residuals/draw_both/Fit()#2 residuals/draw_both
home Fit·other@residuals/draw_both/Fit.lend residuals/draw_both
home Fit·self@residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw#2/?1 residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw#2
home Fit·self@residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw#2/?2 residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw#2
home Fit·other@residuals/draw_both/Fit.draw#2 residuals/draw_both
home Fit·fit@residuals/draw_both residuals

side entry left
side Figure 1 · Fit · fit.fig right
side Figure 2 · Fit · fit.res_fig right
side Figure 3 · Fit · other.fig right
